---
/** Mark + wordmark logo used in the nav and footer. The mark is jsrt's terminal card
 * (the same glyph the docs site uses as its favicon) and follows the text colour. */
---

<span
  style="display: flex; align-items: center; height: 32px; font-family: var(--font-text); font-weight: 600; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--c-ink); white-space: nowrap; gap: 8px;"
>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0;">
    <rect x="8" y="6" width="48" height="52" rx="8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="6"></rect>
    <path
      d="M20 22h24M20 32h24M20 42h14"
      fill="none"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="6"
      stroke-linecap="round"
    ></path>
  </svg>
  jsrt
</span>
